  "statement": "Your calendar is a mess of overlapping meeting blocks.\n\nGiven a list of `intervals` where each interval is `[start, end]` with `start <= end`, merge every group of intervals that **overlap or touch** (for example `[1, 3]` and `[3, 5]` touch) and return the merged intervals **sorted by start**.",
  "function": {
    "name": "merge_intervals",
    "params": [
